{"id":"26271d2146c7481f","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-topos-hol.md","title":"thm-topos-internal-hol","display":"thm-topos-internal-hol","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-topos-hol","aliases":["16-thm-topos-hol","16-thm--topos-hol"],"display":"thm-topos-internal-hol","depends_on":["[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","[[16-df-topos-5]]","[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]","[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]"],"review_status":"resolved-hol-syntax-semantics-proof","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J16","review_date":"2026-10-16","verification_status":"source-rules-and-local-derivation-induction","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-16","current_review_boundary":"Explicit local intuitionistic HOL with finite products, exponents, Prop, quantifiers, equality and entailment extensionality; manual derivation induction, no machine verification or categorical completeness claim.","source":"Definition5.1.3 pp.314–315 (PDF334–335); Figure4.1 pp.225–226 (PDF245–246); Lemma5.3.7 p.336 (PDF356); Corollary5.4.9 p.345 (PDF365); local full reconstruction"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-topos-hol"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-topos-hol</span><span>16-thm--topos-hol</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-topos-internal-hol"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" href=\"?note=8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" title=\"16-df-topos-5\">16-df-topos-5</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" href=\"?note=923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" title=\"16-df-simple-type-semantics\">16-df-simple-type-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"resolved-hol-syntax-semantics-proof"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J16"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-rules-and-local-derivation-induction"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"current_review_boundary","html":"Explicit local intuitionistic HOL with finite products, exponents, Prop, quantifiers, equality and entailment extensionality; manual derivation induction, no machine verification or categorical completeness claim."},{"key":"source","html":"Definition5.1.3 pp.314–315 (PDF334–335); Figure4.1 pp.225–226 (PDF245–246); Lemma5.3.7 p.336 (PDF356); Corollary5.4.9 p.345 (PDF365); local full reconstruction"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega\">\\(\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega\\)</span> 是指定分类子。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" href=\"?note=8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" title=\"16-df-topos-5\">16-df-topos-5</a> 的等价与 Corollary5.4.9 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\rm Sub}\">\\(p_{\\rm Sub}\\)</span> 是一阶/高阶纤维化；选定其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_X,\\bot_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X\">\\(\\top_X,\\bot_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X\\)</span> 与沿积投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi\">\\(\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi\\)</span> 的伴随。它们均是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a> 引用的实际纤维结构，未假设待证的语法可靠性。子对象以同构类表示，序为包含。</li>\n<li>取小集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，其中有特殊原子类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in B\">\\(o\\in B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}=\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\rm STT}(B)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}=\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\rm STT}(B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_B\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_B\\)</span>、位置变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n\">\\(W_n\\)</span>、同时替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[\\mathbf s]\">\\(t[\\mathbf s]\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A\\)</span> 均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span> 为额外常量集，型属 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0:C_0\\to\\mathsf{Ty}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}\">\\(a_0:C_0\\to\\mathsf{Ty}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}\\)</span>。逻辑常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp},\\mathsf{eq}_A,\\mathsf{all}_A,\\mathsf{ex}_A\">\\(\\mathsf T,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp},\\mathsf{eq}_A,\\mathsf{all}_A,\\mathsf{ex}_A\\)</span> 用互不相撞的标签，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span> 不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的常量型属在 Assertion 给出；其转换公理集为空。</li>\n<li>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\mathcal E,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\">\\(M=(\\mathcal E,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\\)</span> 的CCC解释记录，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" href=\"?note=923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" title=\"16-df-simple-type-semantics\">16-df-simple-type-semantics</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(o)=\\Omega\">\\(\\rho(o)=\\Omega\\)</span>，其他原子类型任取对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_c\">\\(\\kappa_c\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C_0\">\\(c\\in C_0\\)</span> 任取其正确Hom中的箭头。逻辑常量的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 由下文公式构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_M,I_M,p^M_{\\Gamma,i},E^M_{\\Gamma,A}\">\\(T_M,I_M,p^M_{\\Gamma,i},E^M_{\\Gamma,A}\\)</span> 及语义元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^M_\\Gamma\">\\(A^M_\\Gamma\\)</span> 均采用该页精确递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_0:I_M(())\\to1\">\\(!_0:I_M(())\\to1\\)</span> 是到分类子所选终对象的唯一箭头；不要求CCC记录的终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_M(())\">\\(I_M(())\\)</span> 与该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 字面相同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_{\\Omega,T}:\\Omega^T\\times T\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_{\\Omega,T}:\\Omega^T\\times T\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 表示固定CCC数据中的评价箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(S):X\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\chi(S):X\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\">\\(S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\)</span> 表示唯一分类箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(h)^*S\">\\((h)^*S\\)</span> 是拉回。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 的有限子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi\\)</span> 为带标签序贯编码；下列推理式的结论及序贯前提要求属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf J\">\\(\\mathsf J\\)</span>；分子中STLC类型/转换判断是实例筛选条件，不是HOL推导前提。它们采用与序贯不相交的判断标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|\\Gamma|\">\\(n=|\\Gamma|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta^+=\\{W_n\\psi\\mid\\psi\\in\\theta\\}\">\\(\\theta^+=\\{W_n\\psi\\mid\\psi\\in\\theta\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^+x=\\operatorname{app}(W_nP,x_{n+1})\">\\(P^+x=\\operatorname{app}(W_nP,x_{n+1})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P t=\\operatorname{app}(P,t)\">\\(P t=\\operatorname{app}(P,t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\xi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\xi\\)</span> 均为当前语境的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 型项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf s\">\\(\\mathbf s\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma s_i:\\Gamma_i\">\\(\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma s_i:\\Gamma_i\\)</span> 的同时替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta[\\mathbf s]=\\{\\psi[\\mathbf s]\\mid\\psi\\in\\theta\\}\">\\(\\theta[\\mathbf s]=\\{\\psi[\\mathbf s]\\mid\\psi\\in\\theta\\}\\)</span>。替换规则只取这些良型实例。</li>\n<li>下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\rm disp}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\rm disp}\\)</span> 是展示推理式的全部有限实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是已成立STLC判断的编码集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_H\">\\(\\mathcal R_H\\)</span> 正式删除这些已成立侧条件后只保留序贯前提；等式、量词与外延性规则的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}\\)</span>。replacement中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\">\\(\\zeta\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 型项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\">\\(\\mathbf x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_\\star\">\\(\\mu_\\star\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A^{\\exists},Q_A^{\\forall}\">\\(Q_A^{\\exists},Q_A^{\\forall}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧\">\\(⟦-⟧\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IHOLSound}_{\\mathcal E}(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{IHOLSound}_{\\mathcal E}(M)\\)</span> 全由下文定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC_H&amp;\\coloneqq C_0\\sqcup\\{\\mathsf T,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}\n\\sqcup\\{\\mathsf{eq}_A,\\mathsf{all}_A,\\mathsf{ex}_A\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\na_H(c)&amp;\\coloneqq a_0(c)\\quad(c\\in C_0),\\\\\na_H(\\mathsf T)&amp;\\coloneqq((),o),\\quad a_H(\\mathsf F)\\coloneqq((),o),\\\\\na_H(c)&amp;\\coloneqq((o,o),o)\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}),\\\\\na_H(\\mathsf{eq}_A)&amp;\\coloneqq((A,A),o),\\\\\na_H(\\mathsf{all}_A)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\langle A\\to o\\rangle,o),\\quad a_H(\\mathsf{ex}_A)\\coloneqq(\\langle A\\to o\\rangle,o),\\\\\n\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq(B,C_H,a_H,\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{|\\Gamma|}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\varphi:o\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_B\\land\n\\theta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma))\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC_H&amp;\\coloneqq C_0\\sqcup\\{\\mathsf T,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}\n\\sqcup\\{\\mathsf{eq}_A,\\mathsf{all}_A,\\mathsf{ex}_A\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}\\},\\\\\na_H(c)&amp;\\coloneqq a_0(c)\\quad(c\\in C_0),\\\\\na_H(\\mathsf T)&amp;\\coloneqq((),o),\\quad a_H(\\mathsf F)\\coloneqq((),o),\\\\\na_H(c)&amp;\\coloneqq((o,o),o)\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp}\\}),\\\\\na_H(\\mathsf{eq}_A)&amp;\\coloneqq((A,A),o),\\\\\na_H(\\mathsf{all}_A)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\langle A\\to o\\rangle,o),\\quad a_H(\\mathsf{ex}_A)\\coloneqq(\\langle A\\to o\\rangle,o),\\\\\n\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq(B,C_H,a_H,\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_{|\\Gamma|}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\varphi:o\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf J&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_B\\land\n\\theta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma))\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}(\\Gamma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu_\\star&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi\\bigl(\\pi_1^*[\\top]\\star_{\\Omega\\times\\Omega}\\pi_2^*[\\top]\\bigr)\n\\quad(\\star\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow\\}),\\\\\nQ_A^{\\exists}&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi\\bigl(\\Sigma_{\\pi_1}(\\operatorname{ev}_{\\Omega,T_MA}^*[\\top])\\bigr),\\qquad\nQ_A^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\chi\\bigl(\\Pi_{\\pi_1}(\\operatorname{ev}_{\\Omega,T_MA}^*[\\top])\\bigr)\n\\quad\\bigl(\\pi_1:\\Omega^{T_MA}\\times T_MA\\to\\Omega^{T_MA}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf T}&amp;\\coloneqq\\top\\circ!_0,\\quad\\kappa_{\\mathsf F}\\coloneqq\\chi(\\bot_{I_M(())}),\\\\\n\\kappa_c&amp;\\coloneqq\\mu_\\star\\langle p^M_{(o,o),1},p^M_{(o,o),2}\\rangle\n\\quad\\bigl((c,\\star)\\in\\{(\\mathsf{and},\\wedge),(\\mathsf{or},\\vee),(\\mathsf{imp},\\Rightarrow)\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf{eq}_A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi([\\delta_{T_MA}])\\langle p^M_{(A,A),1},p^M_{(A,A),2}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf{all}_A}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_A^{\\forall}p^M_{(A\\to o),1},\\qquad\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf{ex}_A}\\coloneqq Q_A^{\\exists}p^M_{(A\\to o),1},\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash t:A⟧_M&amp;\\coloneqq E^M_{\\Gamma,A}(t),\\\\\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq(E^M_{\\Gamma,o}(\\varphi))^*[\\top],\\\\\n⟦\\theta⟧_{M,\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigwedge_{\\psi\\in\\theta}⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu_\\star&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi\\bigl(\\pi_1^*[\\top]\\star_{\\Omega\\times\\Omega}\\pi_2^*[\\top]\\bigr)\n\\quad(\\star\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow\\}),\\\\\nQ_A^{\\exists}&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi\\bigl(\\Sigma_{\\pi_1}(\\operatorname{ev}_{\\Omega,T_MA}^*[\\top])\\bigr),\\qquad\nQ_A^{\\forall}\\coloneqq\\chi\\bigl(\\Pi_{\\pi_1}(\\operatorname{ev}_{\\Omega,T_MA}^*[\\top])\\bigr)\n\\quad\\bigl(\\pi_1:\\Omega^{T_MA}\\times T_MA\\to\\Omega^{T_MA}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf T}&amp;\\coloneqq\\top\\circ!_0,\\quad\\kappa_{\\mathsf F}\\coloneqq\\chi(\\bot_{I_M(())}),\\\\\n\\kappa_c&amp;\\coloneqq\\mu_\\star\\langle p^M_{(o,o),1},p^M_{(o,o),2}\\rangle\n\\quad\\bigl((c,\\star)\\in\\{(\\mathsf{and},\\wedge),(\\mathsf{or},\\vee),(\\mathsf{imp},\\Rightarrow)\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf{eq}_A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi([\\delta_{T_MA}])\\langle p^M_{(A,A),1},p^M_{(A,A),2}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf{all}_A}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_A^{\\forall}p^M_{(A\\to o),1},\\qquad\n\\kappa_{\\mathsf{ex}_A}\\coloneqq Q_A^{\\exists}p^M_{(A\\to o),1},\\\\\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash t:A⟧_M&amp;\\coloneqq E^M_{\\Gamma,A}(t),\\\\\n⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq(E^M_{\\Gamma,o}(\\varphi))^*[\\top],\\\\\n⟦\\theta⟧_{M,\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigwedge_{\\psi\\in\\theta}⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\rm disp}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}\\ (\\varphi\\in\\theta),\\qquad\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf T()},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf F()}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta&#39;\\triangleright\\varphi}\\ (\\theta\\subseteq\\theta&#39;),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Delta\\mid\\theta[\\mathbf s]\\triangleright\\varphi[\\mathbf s]},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\varphi\\equiv\\psi:o}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi\\quad\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\quad\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\triangleright\\xi\\quad\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\cup\\{\\psi\\}\\triangleright\\xi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\xi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\triangleright\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\quad\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{all}_A(\\lambda_A\\varphi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{all}_A(P)\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright Pt},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright Pt\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{ex}_A(P)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{ex}_A(P)\\quad\n\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\cup\\{P^+x\\}\\triangleright W_n\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(u,t)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)\\quad\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(u,v)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,v)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)\\quad\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\zeta[\\mathbf x,t]}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\zeta[\\mathbf x,u]},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma P:A\\to o\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma Q:A\\to o\\quad\n\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\cup\\{P^+x\\}\\triangleright Q^+x\\quad\n\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\cup\\{Q^+x\\}\\triangleright P^+x}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_{A\\to o}(P,Q)}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_{\\rm disp}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}\\ (\\varphi\\in\\theta),\\qquad\n\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf T()},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf F()}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta&#39;\\triangleright\\varphi}\\ (\\theta\\subseteq\\theta&#39;),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Delta\\mid\\theta[\\mathbf s]\\triangleright\\varphi[\\mathbf s]},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\varphi\\equiv\\psi:o}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi\\quad\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{and}(\\varphi,\\psi)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{or}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\quad\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\triangleright\\xi\\quad\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\cup\\{\\psi\\}\\triangleright\\xi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\xi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\triangleright\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)\\quad\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\triangleright\\varphi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{all}_A(\\lambda_A\\varphi)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{all}_A(P)\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright Pt},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright Pt\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{ex}_A(P)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{ex}_A(P)\\quad\n\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\cup\\{P^+x\\}\\triangleright W_n\\psi}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\psi},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(u,t)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)\\quad\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(u,v)}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,v)},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_A(t,u)\\quad\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\zeta[\\mathbf x,t]}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\zeta[\\mathbf x,u]},\\\\\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma P:A\\to o\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma Q:A\\to o\\quad\n\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\cup\\{P^+x\\}\\triangleright Q^+x\\quad\n\\Gamma,A\\mid\\theta^+\\cup\\{Q^+x\\}\\triangleright P^+x}{\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\triangleright\\mathsf{eq}_{A\\to o}(P,Q)}.\n\\end{gathered}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal T_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma\\vdash t:A)\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:A)\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(P\\cap\\mathsf J,j)\\mid(P,j)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\rm disp}\\land\n(P\\setminus\\mathsf J)\\subseteq\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\nD^0_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nD^{k+1}_H&amp;\\coloneqq D^k_H\\cup\\{j\\in\\mathsf J\\mid\n(\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(D^k_H))\\ (P,j)\\in\\mathcal R_H\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\vdash_H\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi)\\in\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}D^k_H,\\\\\n\\mathsf{IHOLSound}_{\\mathcal E}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall(\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi)\\in\\mathsf J)\\bigl[\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\vdash_H\\varphi\\Rightarrow\n⟦\\theta⟧_{M,\\Gamma}\\le_{I_M\\Gamma}⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}\\bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{IHOLSound}_{\\mathcal E}(M),\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\Rightarrow\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash t:A⟧_M\\in\\mathcal E(I_M\\Gamma,T_MA),\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\varphi:o\\Rightarrow\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi:o⟧_M\\in\\mathcal E(I_M\\Gamma,\\Omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal T_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\Gamma\\vdash t:A)\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\Gamma\\vdash t\\equiv u:A)\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(P\\cap\\mathsf J,j)\\mid(P,j)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\rm disp}\\land\n(P\\setminus\\mathsf J)\\subseteq\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\nD^0_H&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nD^{k+1}_H&amp;\\coloneqq D^k_H\\cup\\{j\\in\\mathsf J\\mid\n(\\exists P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\rm fin}(D^k_H))\\ (P,j)\\in\\mathcal R_H\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\vdash_H\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi)\\in\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}D^k_H,\\\\\n\\mathsf{IHOLSound}_{\\mathcal E}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall(\\Gamma,\\theta,\\varphi)\\in\\mathsf J)\\bigl[\n\\Gamma\\mid\\theta\\vdash_H\\varphi\\Rightarrow\n⟦\\theta⟧_{M,\\Gamma}\\le_{I_M\\Gamma}⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\Gamma}\\bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{IHOLSound}_{\\mathcal E}(M),\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\Rightarrow\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash t:A⟧_M\\in\\mathcal E(I_M\\Gamma,T_MA),\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma\\varphi:o\\Rightarrow\n⟦\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi:o⟧_M\\in\\mathcal E(I_M\\Gamma,\\Omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>J16 本轮重建。类型、项、绑定、捕获避免替换及β/η直接使用本书已展开的STLC有限树；Prop取特殊原子o，公式是真正的o型项，可作为参数、函数结果及量词对象。逻辑常量标签有明确型属，故不靠未定义的“高阶公式”名称。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 用有限集呈现命题语境，内建削弱/收缩/交换；与原书有限列表序贯的可推导内容相同。没有添加排中律，也没有加入原书未默认要求的“内部等式反映转换”规则。</p>\n<p>解释良定义：CCC递归给每个良型项唯一箭头。分类子把每个子对象唯一变为Ω值箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_\\star\">\\(\\mu_\\star\\)</span> 的拉回给对应纤维联结词；量词的泛谓词是评价箭头真值的拉回，参数BC使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A\">\\(Q_A\\)</span> 解释任意语境中该类型上的量化，而不是仅量化全局元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{eq}_A\">\\(\\mathsf{eq}_A\\)</span> 取对角线特征箭头。左嵌套语境积中的额外终因子由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^M\">\\(p^M\\)</span> 正确去掉。零元常量的源为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_M(())\">\\(I_M(())\\)</span>；真值箭头显式前接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_0\">\\(!_0\\)</span>，假值取该同一对象上的底子对象分类箭头。终对象之间的唯一同构及重索引保顶、底保证这仍解释真与假，因此不依赖两项终对象选择字面相等。所有κ源靶恰与STLC常量型属一致。</p>\n<p>替换引理：设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\Gamma_i}(s_i))\">\\(s=A^M_\\Gamma(E^M_{\\Delta,\\Gamma_i}(s_i))\\)</span>，STLC结构归纳给项解释复合公式；拉回真值即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦\\varphi[\\mathbf s]⟧=s^*⟦\\varphi⟧\">\\(⟦\\varphi[\\mathbf s]⟧=s^*⟦\\varphi⟧\\)</span>。它也解释量词内部的λ绑定；λ分支由转置自然性，量词constant分支由参数BC。因重索引保有限meet，命题语境的替换同步成立。STLC转换可靠性逐β/η及同余规则成立，故转换规则保持同一子对象。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_H^k\">\\(D_H^k\\)</span> 归纳证明可靠性，逐类规则如下。假设/真/假与削弱来自有限meet的下界性、顶/底的泛性质；替换来自上述引理。合取引入消去用meet泛性质，析取引入用join泛性质；析取消去用纤维分配律。蕴涵引入消去用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\wedge Y\\le Z\\Leftrightarrow X\\le(Y\\Rightarrow Z)\">\\(X\\wedge Y\\le Z\\Leftrightarrow X\\le(Y\\Rightarrow Z)\\)</span>。全称引入用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi^*\\dashv\\Pi_\\pi\">\\(\\pi^*\\dashv\\Pi_\\pi\\)</span>，全称消去用余单位后沿所代入项的图拉回。存在引入用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\pi\\dashv\\pi^*\">\\(\\Sigma_\\pi\\dashv\\pi^*\\)</span> 的单位后沿项图拉回；存在消去把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi^*⟦\\theta⟧\\wedge⟦ Px⟧\\le\\pi^*⟦\\psi⟧\">\\(\\pi^*⟦\\theta⟧\\wedge⟦ Px⟧\\le\\pi^*⟦\\psi⟧\\)</span> 经左伴随及Frobenius转成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦\\theta⟧\\wedge\\Sigma_\\pi⟦ Px⟧\\le⟦\\psi⟧\">\\(⟦\\theta⟧\\wedge\\Sigma_\\pi⟦ Px⟧\\le⟦\\psi⟧\\)</span>。规则的结论ψ及θ均来自Γ，所以特征变量条件由位置编码强制满足。</p>\n<p>等式规则：对角线给反身性；交换坐标和对角拉回给对称性，等式关系的复合给传递性。replacement沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,u\\rangle\">\\(\\langle t,u\\rangle\\)</span> 的对角拉回上两个项箭头相等，故任意含该参数的公式解释拉回相同；再用假设meet的包含即得结论。</p>\n<p>蕴涵外延性：取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:S\\rightarrowtail I_M\\Gamma\">\\(m:S\\rightarrowtail I_M\\Gamma\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦\\theta⟧\">\\(⟦\\theta⟧\\)</span>。两前提给评价谓词在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\times T_MA\">\\(S\\times T_MA\\)</span> 上相互包含，因子对象偏序反对称而相等。分类子唯一性使两个评价箭头在该语境相等，指数转置唯一性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(P)m=E(Q)m\">\\(E(P)m=E(Q)m\\)</span>。故m经这两箭头的等化子分解，恰为结论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦\\theta⟧\\le⟦\\mathsf{eq}_{A\\to o}(P,Q)⟧\">\\(⟦\\theta⟧\\le⟦\\mathsf{eq}_{A\\to o}(P,Q)⟧\\)</span>。这正是原书Lemma5.3.7的论证，适用于任意命题假设语境；无需全局元素足够多。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition5.1.3 pp.314–315 (PDF334–335)，Figure4.1 pp.225–226 (PDF245–246)，Lemma5.3.7 p.336 (PDF356)，Corollary5.4.9 p.345 (PDF365)。本页为上述完整逻辑片段提供本地编码、解释与逐规则证明；未声称已构造所有拓扑斯与所有高阶规格的范畴等价，也未提供机器核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-topos-5","status":"resolved","id":"8cc0e0e038ae9b87","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-topos-5]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-topos-5","status":"resolved","id":"8cc0e0e038ae9b87","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega$ 是指定分类子。[[16-df-topos-5]] 的等价与 Corollary5.4.9 保证 $p_{\\rm Sub}$ 是一阶/高阶纤维化；选定其 $\\top_X,\\bot_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X$ 与沿积投影 $\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi$ 的伴随。它们均是 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]] 引用的实际纤维结构，未假设待证的语法可靠性。子对象以同构类表示，序为包含。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega$ 是指定分类子。[[16-df-topos-5]] 的等价与 Corollary5.4.9 保证 $p_{\\rm Sub}$ 是一阶/高阶纤维化；选定其 $\\top_X,\\bot_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X$ 与沿积投影 $\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi$ 的伴随。它们均是 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]] 引用的实际纤维结构，未假设待证的语法可靠性。子对象以同构类表示，序为包含。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取小集合 $B$，其中有特殊原子类型 $o\\in B$。$\\mathsf{Ty}=\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\rm STT}(B)$、$\\mathsf{Ctx}_B$、位置变量、$W_n$、同时替换 $t[\\mathbf s]$ 及 $\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A$、$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A$ 均采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]。$C_0$ 为额外常量集，型属 $a_0:C_0\\to\\mathsf{Ty}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}$。逻辑常量 $\\mathsf T,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp},\\mathsf{eq}_A,\\mathsf{all}_A,\\mathsf{ex}_A$ 用互不相撞的标签，且与 $C_0$ 不交。$\\Sigma$ 的常量型属在 Assertion 给出；其转换公理集为空。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 $M=(\\mathcal E,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)$ 的CCC解释记录，采用 [[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]，$\\rho(o)=\\Omega$，其他原子类型任取对象；$\\kappa_c$ 对 $c\\in C_0$ 任取其正确Hom中的箭头。逻辑常量的 $\\kappa$ 由下文公式构造。$T_M,I_M,p^M_{\\Gamma,i},E^M_{\\Gamma,A}$ 及语义元组 $A^M_\\Gamma$ 均采用该页精确递归。$!_0:I_M(())\\to1$ 是到分类子所选终对象的唯一箭头；不要求CCC记录的终对象 $I_M(())$ 与该 $1$ 字面相同。$\\operatorname{ev}_{\\Omega,T}:\\Omega^T\\times T\\to\\Omega$ 表示固定CCC数据中的评价箭头；$\\chi(S):X\\to\\Omega$ 对 $S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$ 表示唯一分类箭头；$(h)^*S$ 是拉回。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\rm Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_X,\\bot_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"o\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}=\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\rm STT}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}_B","display":false},{"tex":"W_n","display":false},{"tex":"t[\\mathbf s]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:A","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false},{"tex":"a_0:C_0\\to\\mathsf{Ty}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf T,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf{and},\\mathsf{or},\\mathsf{imp},\\mathsf{eq}_A,\\mathsf{all}_A,\\mathsf{ex}_A","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M=(\\mathcal E,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(o)=\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_c","display":